rated missions from your fellow villagers, collecting important resources to help your community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077720/extras/81c56a704e5cb9163cdea9fd7e20f514.poster.avif?t=1754227626\" width=500 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077720/extras/81c56a704e5cb9163cdea9fd7e20f514.webm?t=1754227626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077720/extras/81c56a704e5cb9163cdea9fd7e20f514.mp4?t=1754227626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The archipelagoes are procedurally generated, therefore, every journey to the floating islands offers a unique and unpredictable experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077720/extras/a72da5c1d865465c554740279025f112.poster.avif?t=1754227626\" width=500 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077720/extras/a72da5c1d865465c554740279025f112.webm?t=1754227626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077720/extras/a72da5c1d865465c554740279025f112.mp4?t=1754227626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a diverse array of enemies and engage in thrilling and epic boss fights. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077720/extras/0fdb412b849285683e93b5335445d25f.poster.avif?t=1754227626\" width=500 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077720/extras/0fdb412b849285683e93b5335445d25f.webm?t=1754227626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077720/extras/0fdb412b849285683e93b5335445d25f.mp4?t=1754227626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade resources for Seeds, the in-game currency, to purchase new equipment, upgrade your tools, and most importantly, enhance your flying car to explore increasingly distant archipelagoes and progress through the story.</p>",
